/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 106 0 R
/T (The Department of English at GGU was established in 2024, giving it a separate and distinct identity within the university. It has a team of ten dedicated and experienced faculty members who are committed to student development and offers Ph.D. programmes and promotes research in language, Literature and communication. It follows a practical and skill-based teaching approach to help students improve their communication, thinking, and professional skills. One of the proud achievements of the department is its international teaching experience. The faculty successfully trained students from African countries for eight months, starting from basic alphabet learning and guiding them up to Cambridge English certification. The department focuses on preparing students to meet global participation through innovative teaching methods and real-life learning practices. With a clear vision, the Department of English aims to develop confident communicators and responsible individuals ready to face global challenges.)
/E (The Department of English at GGU was established in 2024, giving it a separate and distinct identity within the university. It has a team of ten dedicated and experienced faculty members who are committed to student development and offers Ph.D. programmes and promotes research in language, Literature and communication. It follows a practical and skill-based teaching approach to help students improve their communication, thinking, and professional skills. One of the proud achievements of the department is its international teaching experience. The faculty successfully trained students from African countries for eight months, starting from basic alphabet learning and guiding them up to Cambridge English certification. The department focuses on preparing students to meet global participation through innovative teaching methods and real-life learning practices. With a clear vision, the Department of English aims to develop confident communicators and responsible individuals ready to face global challenges.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
