/T (Conference Objectives: 1. To explore how language teaching evolves in the age of intelligent technologies 2. To create a space where tradition meets innovation in English studies 3. To encourage teachers to rethink methods with creativity and confidence 4. To bridge literature, technology, and human values in meaningful ways 5. To inspire educators to become lifelong learners in a changing world 6. To nurture ethical, sensitive, and responsible use of AI in classrooms 7. To celebrate the power of words even in a digital age)
/E (Conference Objectives: 1. To explore how language teaching evolves in the age of intelligent technologies 2. To create a space where tradition meets innovation in English studies 3. To encourage teachers to rethink methods with creativity and confidence 4. To bridge literature, technology, and human values in meaningful ways 5. To inspire educators to become lifelong learners in a changing world 6. To nurture ethical, sensitive, and responsible use of AI in classrooms 7. To celebrate the power of words even in a digital age)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [0]
>>
